OL,3,ASeveral dead in major fire after
OL,4,Aincident at Canadian military base
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeveral people have been killed and
OL,7,Finjured after a large fire tore through
OL,8,Fa Canadian military base in Alberta,
OL,9,Fofficials say - here's what we know so
OL,10,Ffar
OL,12,FDetails are still unclear, but Canadian
OL,13,Fmedia report that at least seven were
OL,14,Fkilled and dozens more injured when a
OL,15,Fgas line or gas well was hit during a
OL,16,Flive-fire training exercise
OL,18,FDefence Minister David McGuinty says he
OL,19,F"cannot recall an incident like this in
OL,20,Frecent memory"
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/38
