OL,3,AOil facilities hit in deadly overnight
OL,4,Aattack on St Petersburg
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least one person has been killed in
OL,7,Fan overnight attack on St Petersburg
OL,8,Fthat successfully targeted two of the
OL,9,Fcity's oil facilities.
OL,11,FThe region's Governor Alexander Beglov
OL,12,Fsaid fires were being extinguished at
OL,13,Fthe St Petersburg Oil Terminal and the
OL,14,FRuchyi oil depot following the attack,
OL,15,Fwhich also injured at least five.
OL,17,FA logistics centre belonging to Ozon -
OL,18,Fknown as Russia's Amazon - and a data
OL,19,Fcentre belonging to Facebook equivalent
OL,20,FVKontakte were also hit.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/38
